4434610/extras/bfc9e42ab773712b11429f81ae528625.poster.avif?t=1774547993\" width=1170 height=62 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434610/extras/bfc9e42ab773712b11429f81ae528625.webm?t=1774547993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434610/extras/bfc9e42ab773712b11429f81ae528625.mp4?t=1774547993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranoia is your greatest survival weapon, because the truth is they’re out there, hiding in the streets of the Big Apple. This bartender could be a werewolf. The store clerk who shot you a smile might be a ghoul. This priest is really a vampire. To unmask and defeat them, you’ll need to use every means at your disposal. But be careful: acting without precaution can draw unwanted attention. You risk ending up on a police record or garnering the attention of far more powerful organisations with little regard for your goals, only theirs. You’re not the only player in this underworld war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your quest for the truth will lead you through the back streets of New York and beyond the East Coast. You’ll start to uncover the reality hidden within the World of Darkness, but the truth is more horrifying than you ever imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434610/extras/cfd5e8a76fae496f7b6555e902ba9022.poster.avif?t=1774547993\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434610/extras/cfd5e8a76fae496f7b6555e902ba9022.webm?t=1774547993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434610/extras/cfd5e8a76fae496f7b6555e902ba9022.mp4?t=1774547993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "In the bustling streets of New York, passersby are unaware of the evil lurking in the shadows. You, however, know. Hunt the creatures of the World of Darkness in this action RPG, where your choices determine whether you live another day.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434610/7f5ad767bea2fc6c384564e5a5a42394870f1b0b/header.jpg?t=1774547993", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434610/199e420960de88130b29b191b19b51f1a82c5b35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774547993", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434610/199e420960de88130b29b191b19b51f1a82c5b35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774547993", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "Hunter: The Reckoning - Deathwish@2026 Published by NACON & developped by TEYON<br />\r\n<br />\r\n© 2026 Nacon, © 2026 Paradox Interactive AB. All Rights Reserved.<b